## Modifications

The following changes were made for this repository and are released under the
MIT License (see `LICENSE`):

- The runtime hue variable and `calc()` expressions were replaced with the
  literal hue `260`.
- Invalid `oklch(..., 0.4)` alpha syntax was corrected to `oklch(... / 0.4)`.
- Border-radius values in the base layout were parameterized with
  `--giscus-radius-card` / `--giscus-radius-control` for the sharp-corner
  variants.
- The theme was split into eight static entry files (two full themes plus six
  `@import` wrappers).
